  "voice": "<figure class=\"f-plate\" id=\"voice\" style=\"height:368px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center\"><div class=\"f-head\"><b>Voice first</b><span>Three levels of response</span></div><div class=\"f-cols\"><div class=\"f-level\" style=\"height:184px\"><div class=\"f-sq\"><i class=\"\"></i><i class=\"off\"></i><i class=\"off\"></i></div><div class=\"f-foot\"><i class=\"bar\"></i></div><span class=\"f-lv\">Lv.1</span><b>Done directly</b><p>A simple request, done in the conversation.</p></div><div class=\"f-level f-emph\" style=\"height:184px\"><div class=\"f-sq\"><i class=\"\"></i><i class=\"\"></i><i class=\"off\"></i></div><div class=\"f-foot\"><i class=\"bar\"></i><i class=\"card\"></i></div><span class=\"f-lv\">Lv.2</span><b>Atomic card</b><p>A value matters; the driver adjusts it.</p></div><div class=\"f-level\" style=\"height:184px\"><div class=\"f-sq\"><i class=\"\"></i><i class=\"\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><div class=\"f-foot\"><i class=\"win\"></i><i class=\"bar\"></i></div><span class=\"f-lv\">Lv.3</span><b>App window</b><p>The task needs more; the app takes over.</p></div></div></figure>",
